ision</a> Shoulder Sleeve Insignia.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"United States Army Institute of Heraldry","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"US Army","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<i>This image shows a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/flag\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:flag\">flag</a>, a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/coat_of_arms\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:coat of arms\">coat of arms</a>, a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/seal_(device)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:seal (device)\">seal</a> or some other official <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/insignia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:insignia\">insignia</a></b> produced by the <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Army_Institute_of_Heraldry\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:United States Army Institute of Heraldry\">United States Army Institute of Heraldry</a></b>.  It is in the <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/public_domain\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:public domain\">public domain</a></b> but its use is restricted by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/USCODE-2010-title18/pdf/USCODE-2010-title18-partI-chap33-sec704.pdf\">Title 18, United States Code, Section 704</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/18/704\">[1]</a> and the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/granule/CFR-2012-title32-vol3/CFR-2012-title32-vol3-part507/content-detail.html\">Code of Federal Regulations (32 CFR, Part 507)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/cgi-bin/text-idx?mc=true&amp;node=pt32.3.507&amp;rgn=div5\">[2]</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/32/part-507\">[3]</a>.  Permission to use these images in the USA for most commercial purposes must be obtained from The Institute of Heraldry prior to their use.</i>","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/png"}],"revisions":[{"revid":1183630044,"parentid":1029454713,"timestamp":"2026-03-19T18:34:14Z","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Information\n|Description    = [[:en:13th Airborne Division (United States)|13th Airborne Division]] Shoulder Sleeve Insignia.\n|Source         = United States Army Institute of Heraldry\n|Date           = \n|Author         = US Army\n|Permission     = {{PD-USGov-Military-Army-USAIOH}} - US Army Institute Of Heraldry\n|other_versions =\n<gallery>\nFile:13th Airborne Division.patch.jpg|File:13th Airborne Division.patch.jpg\nFile:USA - 13 ABN DIV.png|File:USA - 13 ABN DIV.png\nFile:USA - 13 ABN DIV.svg|File:USA - 13 ABN DIV.svg\n</gallery>\n}}\n\n== Heraldic Items ==\n\n=== Shoulder Sleeve Insignia ===\n\n* Description: On an ultramarine blue shield, a winged unicorn issuant from base in golden orange, all within a green border.\n\n* Symbolism:\n# The unicorn is associated by tradition with qualities of virtue, courage, and strength.\n# The horn of the unicorn signifies extreme courage.\n# The unicorn has been winged to represent its travel in the air as \"airborne.\"\n# The blue background is the color of the infantry which is the basic arm of the division and also indicates the sky.\n\n=== Tab ===\n\n* Description: Immediately above the shoulder sleeve insignia a black arc tab inscribed AIRBORNE in yellow letters.\n\n=== Distinctive Unit Insignia ===\n\n* None approved.\n\n[[Category:13th Airborne Division Heraldry]]\n[[Category:Unicorns in military coats of arms of the United States|United States Army, 013th Airborne Division]]\n[[Category:Unicorns issuant in heraldry|United States Armed Forces, United States Army, 013th Airborne Division]]\n[[Category:Combat service identification badges of United States Army infantry divisions]]\n[[Category:Yellow unicorns]]"}}}]},{"pageid":10528206,"ns":6,"title":"File:67th Infantry Brigade SSI.svg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"timestamp":"2010-06-02T17:36:26Z","user":"Completefailure","size":2754,"width":192,"height":287,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg/1280px-67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1070,"thumbheight":1600,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg/3840px-67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg/1280px-67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1070,"height":1600,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg/3840px-67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:67th_Infantry_Brigade_SSI.svg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=10528206","sha1":"e129c8341fa2f5d977766c9efc8e8